      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about counselors and stuff but it doesnt change the reality. the numbers dont move. no matter what i do, i'm just working to pay for things i already used up years ago. it feels like i'm just a ghost in a machine that keeps demanding more than i have to give. there's no \"one foot in front of the other\" when the ground is just crumbling under you. i just feel so trapped. like there's literally no exit from this.",
